 255            /WHENEVER THERE IS NOTHING BETTER TO DO OR A JOB WANTS TO
 256            /DISMISS ITSELF SO OTHERS CAN TRY THIS ROUTINE IS ENTERED
 257            
 258            /IT KEEPS LOOKING FOR A JOB WITH BITS 0 AND 1 OFF WHICH
 259            /SAYS THAT THE JOB IS NOT WAITING FOR INPUT OR OUTPUT
 260            /RESPECTIVLY
 261            *177
