 364            /*      THIS SWAP ROUTINE EXECUTES WITH INTERRUPT OFF
 365            /*      AND TAKES APPROXIMATELY 600 MICROSECONDS TO
 366            /*      EXECUTE, WHEREAS THE MAXIMUM TIME AVAILABLE
